  "notes": "Smoke-only wake and BLE LED timing correction. Halves the post-battery-frame Wake confirmation from 100 ms to 50 ms while retaining the separate continuously-held GPIO check, so a short charge-level preview still cannot become an unintended power-on. Normal connected BLE sessions no longer perform routine SPIFFS diagnostic writes or persist scan/heap health chatter on the single ESP32-C3 core; the bounded RAM queue keeps the newest records and flushes after disconnect, while foreground OTA/DFU checkpoints remain persistent. High-frequency generation and connected-status frames now update both main NeoPixels and the physical RMT latch in one serialized transaction, preventing competing status writers from exposing a partial two-LED frame. BLE memory sampling and safe disconnected-idle recovery remain enabled. Twin Button firmware content remains unchanged.",
